  "title": "Mom&#39;s Christmas Fudge",
  "description": "This fudge with chocolate chips, peanut butter, and sweetened condensed milk has been a Christmas staple in our house since the early 1980s. Ridiculously easy and pretty yummy.",
  "authors": [
    "FrackFamily5 CACT"
